[27.789403, "o", "Note: switching to '4701c3c62441077cc44a6553bf6ae909d99b8351'."]
[27.790107, "o", "\r\n"]
[27.790292, "o", "\r\n"]
[27.790678, "o", "You are in 'detached HEAD' state. You can look around, make experimental"]
[27.790961, "o", "\r\n"]
[27.791159, "o", "changes and commit them, and you can discard any commits you make in this"]
[27.791337, "o", "\r\n"]
[27.793494, "o", "state without impacting any branches by switching back to a branch."]
[27.794131, "o", "\r\n"]
[27.794312, "o", "\r\n"]
[27.7945, "o", "If you want to create a new branch to retain commits you create, you may"]
[27.794683, "o", "\r\n"]
[27.794887, "o", "do so (now or later) by using -c with the switch command. Example:"]
[27.79513, "o", "\r\n"]
[27.795308, "o", "\r\n"]
[27.795481, "o", "  git switch -c <new-branch-name>"]
[27.797586, "o", "\r\n"]
[27.802374, "o", "\r\n"]
[27.802698, "o", "Or undo this operation with:"]
[27.803123, "o", "\r\n"]
[27.803299, "o", "\r\n"]
[27.803471, "o", "  git switch -"]
[27.803647, "o", "\r\n"]
[27.803846, "o", "\r\n"]
